WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:28.600
To Beaver, starring Barbara Billingsley, Hugh Beaumont, Tony Dow, Jerry Mathers as the Beaver.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:36.130
Thank you.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:00.560
Yeah, Mom?

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:01.990
