00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:36.830
Oh, yes. The monster has returned to his cave.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.930
Well, I guess I better get rid of the orange peels, huh?

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.620
Dear, do you know we didn't mean it?

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:54.300
Oh, that's all right, you know. I'm having a good humor tonight.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:57.550
Here's a letter from Beaver.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.200
Yes, I know.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.640
