00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.520
Look, Beaver, will you cut it out and listen?

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:05.770
Mr. Payton's here with Billy.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.200
He's gonna drive me home and pick you up

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.140
and bring you up here.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.570
That's sure an awful lot of things to do.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:14.000
How come he's doing all that?

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:18.160
Because Billy started to cry.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:21.360
I almost feel like doing that myself.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.450
How long will it take?

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:24.950
About three hours.

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:26.470
Okay, Wally.

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:29.980
Why don't you stay here and eat your...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:43.460
the sandwich you don't want to go forgetting this thanks a lot Wally I hope the rotten apples are

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:43.920
still good

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:04.790
Told you he would be.

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:05.450
Wally!

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:06.820
Wally!

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.300
Wally, we're home!

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:11.440
Wally!

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:15.840
Hi, Dad.

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:16.660
Hi, Mom.

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:17.040
Hi.

00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:19.410
I was, uh, just doing my homework.

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:20.030
Good.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:22.500
Did the Paytons pick up the beaver?

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:25.690
Yeah, uh, yeah.

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:27.010
They picked him up all right.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.310
How was the barbecue?

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:29.190
Oh, fine.

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:32.480
Hey, Mom, can I have something to eat? I'm starved.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:35.240
Well, what about the two big roast beef sandwiches?

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:37.940
What roast beef sandwiches?

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.480
The ones you ate in the kitchen.

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:42.180
Oh, those.

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:45.590
Yeah, well, I'm still kind of hungry.

00:21:46.760 --> 00:21:48.900
Well, I guess I can get you something else.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:52.340
June, I think this young man deserves some credit.

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:53.320
Huh?

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:57.420
Well, you took your brother all the way up to Crystal Falls on the bus,

00:21:57.640 --> 00:21:59.980
saw that the Patons picked him up, came all the way...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.320
back on the bus without a hitch.

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:05.750
Well, I was a little bit worried, but, well, I'm very impressed.

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:06.790
It all went off so well.

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:21.460
Yes, Wally?

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:25.740
Um, well, I don't think I feel so good, Dad.

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:27.460
You mean you're sick?

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:28.800
No.

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:29.940
You're hungry.

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:35.530
No, um, I mean, I don't think I feel so good about what happened today.

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:37.780
What's the matter?

00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:42.470
Well, you know, you said not to let you down and everything,

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.930
but, well, I guess I kind of did.

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:48.130
Well, you said everything was all right.

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:52.440
Yeah, but, well, it really wasn't all right.

00:22:52.780 --> 00:22:54.560
It was sort of a mess.

00:22:55.150 --> 00:22:58.350
Well, we got off for a Sunday at Elmhurst,

00:22:58.370 --> 00:22:59.970
and then Beaver went to get a comic book.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.540
and then he got on the wrong bus.

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.900
Then he landed down here, and I landed up in Crystal Falls.

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:08.200
Then Billy and Mr. Payton brought me back down here in the car.

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:10.700
They picked up Beaver, and they're on their way up there now.

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:14.380
To Crystal Falls.

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:18.800
Wally, I can hardly believe anything like this happened.

00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:23.950
Yeah, Dad. I can hardly believe it either, but, well, it sure did.

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:25.610
Was Beaver all right?

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:29.300
Oh, yeah. Yeah, he's fine, Dad. I'm sorry.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.140
I guess I should have minded him better.

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:35.130
Well, why didn't you tell us this when we first came in?

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:40.030
Well, you were so proud about me being responsible and all.

00:23:40.750 --> 00:23:43.390
Well, I guess I didn't want to let you down in front of Mom.

00:23:45.700 --> 00:23:46.320
Yeah, I see.

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:51.980
Well, I guess we should tell Mom, huh?

00:23:53.020 --> 00:23:54.520
Oh, yes, we certainly should tell her.

00:23:56.140 --> 00:23:56.540
Someday.

00:23:57.960 --> 00:23:59.200
Let's not tell her right now.

00:24:04.636 --> 00:24:05.076
Beave.

00:24:05.372 --> 00:24:06.812
You only use one clean shirt.

00:24:07.388 --> 00:24:09.508
I know. Mom packed them so neat and everything.

00:24:10.140 --> 00:24:11.540
I was afraid she'd get mad at me.

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:12.820
Well, if I messed him up.

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:15.740
Say, up at the farm, did you get to ride Billy's burrow?

00:24:16.220 --> 00:24:16.680
Uh-uh.

00:24:16.928 --> 00:24:18.028
It's only a week old.

00:24:18.684 --> 00:24:20.684
You can't ride them while they're puppies.

00:24:24.060 --> 00:24:25.540
Listen, Beave, um...

00:24:26.108 --> 00:24:27.608
When Dad picked you up at the Paytons,

00:24:27.964 --> 00:24:29.964
Did you say anything?

00:24:30.636 --> 00:24:32.076
You know, about the mess up.

00:24:33.132 --> 00:24:34.192
Oh yeah!

00:24:34.604 --> 00:24:35.744
He got me alone.

00:24:36.076 --> 00:24:38.356
Instead, we're not supposed to say anything about it to Mom.

00:24:43.692 --> 00:24:44.692
How come we're not?

00:24:46.348 --> 00:24:48.708
Well, it's kind of between me and Dad.

00:24:49.164 --> 00:24:50.224
We're going to tell her later.

00:24:51.276 --> 00:24:54.076
It's sort of big people stuff. You wouldn't understand.

00:24:55.500 --> 00:24:56.960
Well, it's okay with me.

00:24:57.452 --> 00:24:58.452
Well, I'm not in trouble.

00:25:32.588 --> 00:25:32.868
Thank you.
